{
  "key": "letter-135-part-01",
  "number": 135,
  "generationId": "01a1e6cd-b6ba-7421-91d5-29c5c598d63d",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.723492
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Wittgenstein has said somewhere: Of that which one cannot speak, one should remain silent.",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.9718369999999998,
      "end": 7.218209
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Oh, if only this advice was heeded there would be no useless arguments about truth!",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/03.mp3",
      "start": 8.391315,
      "end": 12.781858999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "That-which-is cannot be spoken of.",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/04.mp3",
      "start": 13.975918,
      "end": 16.182676
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Whatever is said in words is not, cannot be, that-which-is.",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/05.mp3",
      "start": 17.394852999999998,
      "end": 21.143741000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Truth is beyond words, only silence is related to truth.",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/06.mp3",
      "start": 22.5839,
      "end": 26.07093
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "But silence is very difficult; the mind wants to speak even of that which is beyond words.",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/07.mp3",
      "start": 27.511293,
      "end": 32.727166
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Really, the mind is the only barrier to silence.",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/08.mp3",
      "start": 34.096372,
      "end": 36.668820999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Silence belongs to the state of no-mind.",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/09.mp3",
      "start": 38.096009,
      "end": 40.782925
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "A preacher came to address some small children.",
      "path": "audio/1970-135/10.mp3",
      "start": 42.379501000000005,
      "end": 46.05
    }
  ]
}
